WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.419 --> 00:00:02.620
- I'm so all-in entrepreneur

00:00:02.620 --> 00:00:04.317
I prefer the pain.

00:00:04.317 --> 00:00:05.975
I love the climb.

00:00:05.975 --> 00:00:08.937
To me the setback is exciting.

00:00:08.937 --> 00:00:11.161
I love when 
something goes wrong.

00:00:11.161 --> 00:00:13.064
It's where I shine the most.

00:00:13.624 --> 00:00:15.071
But that's not for everybody.

00:00:15.071 --> 00:00:16.975
Right? I mean it could be
very difficult and when

00:00:16.975 --> 00:00:18.688
you start affecting your life

00:00:18.688 --> 00:00:20.716
and your loved ones and
all the other things

00:00:20.716 --> 00:00:22.620
it can get real nasty.

00:00:22.620 --> 00:00:26.024
To me, the way I handle
things even in the few rare

00:00:26.024 --> 00:00:28.369
days when I really struggle,

00:00:28.369 --> 00:00:29.992
I take a real step back

00:00:29.992 --> 00:00:31.533
and make pretend that 
somebody called me

00:00:31.533 --> 00:00:32.930
and told me that my

00:00:32.930 --> 00:00:35.220
mother or daughter 
were killed.

00:00:35.220 --> 00:00:36.897
and I know that's very dark.

00:00:36.897 --> 00:00:39.504
And I apologize but 
it's really what I do.

00:00:39.504 --> 00:00:42.558
I literally am able to 
at my deepest most struggling

00:00:42.558 --> 00:00:45.786
moment within business,
take a step back and

00:00:45.786 --> 00:00:48.746
remind myself that I could 
make a drillion dollars

00:00:48.746 --> 00:00:50.634
tomorrow on Bitcoin

00:00:50.634 --> 00:00:54.465
and if something bad happened
to the people I love the most

00:00:54.465 --> 00:00:56.024
that it would mean nothing.

00:00:56.024 --> 00:00:58.212
And it very consistently

00:00:58.212 --> 00:01:00.903
re-wires me very quickly.

00:01:00.903 --> 00:01:03.352
I just put business
in perspective.

00:01:03.352 --> 00:01:04.621
At the end of the day,

00:01:05.491 --> 00:01:07.431
it's money, for me,
its not really money,

00:01:07.431 --> 00:01:09.897
it's my legacy so I get hurt 
by it a little bit more.

00:01:13.877 --> 00:01:15.152
I put it in perspective.

00:01:15.152 --> 00:01:16.746
It's money. And you know what?

00:01:16.746 --> 00:01:19.185
Up until I had a daughter,
even while I was married,

00:01:19.185 --> 00:01:22.381
up until when I had 
Misha four years ago

00:01:22.381 --> 00:01:25.201
I secretly wanted to 
lose all my money.

00:01:25.201 --> 00:01:27.769
I had this weird, twisted

00:01:27.769 --> 00:01:30.029
dark fantasy of losing

00:01:30.029 --> 00:01:33.002
everything just to rise
again like a phoenix

00:01:33.002 --> 00:01:34.714
and remind you
mother fuckers.

00:01:34.714 --> 00:01:36.272
(laughter)

